WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Make the boundary visible.

00:05.000 --> 00:13.000
Start with a safe prompt. Inspect provider readiness. Report the safe result.

00:13.000 --> 00:22.000
Route first. Execute second. The decision plane is advisory; execution stays host-owned.

00:22.000 --> 00:32.000
Know what can run. Provider identity, health, and readiness stay separate.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.000
Bound the blast radius. Read-only policy, local data flow, external writes disabled.

00:42.000 --> 00:50.000
Leave a receipt. Facts, source pins, and unknowns remain visible.

00:50.000 --> 00:54.000
System Agentic AI — provider-neutral execution with evidence.
